    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Weinkarte • Winelist",
      "Barkarte • bar drinks • *#K\nÖsterre his hes Bier / Austrian beer / DH N\nPrickelndes / stilles Mineralwasser / sparkling / still mineral water /\nTonic / T\nAlmdudler/20\nSchweppes Bitter Lemon / 4*1*70k\nOrangensaft / orange juice / t0.7t\nApfelsaft / apple juice / *#7\nTomatensaft / tomato juice / i/l\nMartini Extra Dry /#/27\nCompari / c\nAbsolut Vodka///\nBacardi / T/45x4\nJohnnie Walker Red Label / RE\nFour Re/L\nChivas Regal / 21112\nRemy Martin SOP / 1%. VSOP\nFernet Branca / #442*\nSherry \"Tio Pepe\" /TAIN\nCalvados/ *#ń₺#\nPorten warmester Burner poten\nBaileys Irish Cream /TAT\nwine\nIn order for a good grapevine to ripen to perfection it needs nutrient-rich soil, a good\ngeographical position and weather conditions as well as lots of care and attention.\nWinemaking demands purity, in-depth knowledge and the creative imagination of the\ncellarmaster. When creating our wine list, we take care that only the typical, expressive\nwines that conform to these rigorous demands are selected.\nmine\nWhat are you in the mood for? Try the delicacies we have selected for you and choose\nwhat takes your fancy! Our cabin attendants are happy to recommend the wines exactly\nmatching to each course. To keep your senses sharp during your flight, we recommend\ndrinking plenty of water.\nfine\nWhat could be better, when enjoying artistically served light cuisine, harmonious, noble\ndrops of wine and inspiring music, than to think of clear mountain streams in radiant\nsunshine, the fresh smells of spring and lush green mountain meadows...\n\"No pleasure is temporary, for the impression it leaves behind endures!\",\nas Johann Wolfgang von Goethe once noted."
    ],
